---
title: Jaunty.FlatFiles — Query Data Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer Code
    participant FDB as FlatFileDatabase
    participant Src as FileSource
    participant Dial as DuckDbDialect
    participant DDB as DuckDB (in-memory)
    participant Mat as Jaunty Materialization

    Dev->>FDB: FlatFileDatabase.Open("sales.csv")
    FDB->>Src: Create CsvFileSource("sales.csv")
    Src->>Dial: GenerateCreateViewSql()
    Dial-->>Src: CREATE VIEW sales AS SELECT * FROM read_csv_auto(...)
    Src->>DDB: Execute CREATE VIEW
    DDB-->>FDB: View registered

    Dev->>FDB: .Query<SalesRecord>().Where(x => x.Revenue > 10000).Take(50)
    FDB->>Dial: Generate SQL from expression tree
    Dial-->>FDB: SELECT * FROM "sales" WHERE "Revenue" > $1 LIMIT 50
    FDB->>DDB: Execute SQL via DuckDBCommand
    DDB-->>FDB: DbDataReader with results
    FDB->>Mat: Materialize DbDataReader → List<SalesRecord>
    Mat-->>Dev: List<SalesRecord> (strongly typed)
